        - generic [ref=e191]:
          - heading "Student-Initiated Renewal & Admin Governance Rules" [level=4] [ref=e192]
          - generic [ref=e197]:
            - generic [ref=e198]:
              - paragraph [ref=e199]: 1. Student-Owned Renewals
              - paragraph [ref=e200]: Students initiate and complete their own monthly renewals from their account. Administrators observe activity but never trigger paid renewals.
            - generic [ref=e201]:
              - paragraph [ref=e202]: 2. Zero Payment Generation
              - paragraph [ref=e203]: Managing or observing expired subscriptions never creates transactions. Financial records exist only in Payments & Revenue.
            - generic [ref=e204]:
              - paragraph [ref=e205]: 3. Pure Complimentary Access
              - paragraph [ref=e206]: Complimentary scholarship grants are recorded under Manual Access with audit justifications, strictly separated from paid subscription revenue.